ith time to allow the liquid in the microcapsules to pervade throughout the building base material.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un matériau de construction comprenant un matériau de construction de base et des microcapsules dans lesquelles est incorporé un liquide contenant du hinokitiol. Ces microcapsules sont mélangées au matériau de construction de base en grande quantité, la rupture de ces microcapsules dans ce matériau de construction de base due à des modifications dans le temps permettant au liquide contenu dans lesdites microcapsules de pénétrer dans le matériau de construction de base.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>